@18014 = ~quaffs a potion of magic protection~
@18015 = ~quaffs a potion of stone giant strength~
@18016 = ~quaffs a potion of frost giant strength~
@18017 = ~quaffs a potion of regeneration~
@18018 = ~quaffs a potion of fire giant strength~
@18019 = ~quaffs a potion of magic shielding~
@18020 = ~quaffs a potion of cloud giant strength~
@18021 = ~quaffs a potion of magic blocking~
@18022 = ~quaffs a potion of storm giant strength~

